%% Mermaid Architecture Overview

%% 1) Container diagram
flowchart LR
  subgraph Clients
    Web[Web App (Vite/React)]
    Mobile[Mobile App (React Native)]
  end
  Web -->|HTTP /api/*| Gateway[Super API (Fastify)]
  Mobile -->|HTTP /api/*| Gateway
  Mobile -->|WS /api/msg/ws| Gateway

  Gateway -->|/api/wallet| Wallet[Wallet Service]
  Gateway -->|/api/media| Media[Media Service]
  Gateway -->|/api/search| Search[Search Service]
  Gateway -->|/api/mod| Moderation[Moderation Service]
  Gateway -->|/api/msg| Messaging[Messaging (WS)]
  Gateway -->|/api/events| EventsPy[Events Service (Python)]

  subgraph Data Stores
    PG[(Postgres)]
    Redis[(Redis)]
    MinIO[(MinIO S3)]
    TS[(Typesense)]
  end

  Wallet --> PG
  EventsPy --> PG
  Moderation --> PG
  Messaging --> Redis
  Media --> MinIO
  Search --> TS

%% 2) Auth/OTP -> JWT issuance -> /devices
sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant SuperAPI as Super API
  participant Redis
  Client->>SuperAPI: POST /api/auth/otp (phone)
  SuperAPI->>Redis: Store OTP (TTL)
  Client->>SuperAPI: POST /api/auth/verify (otp)
  SuperAPI-->>Client: 200 JWT (HS256)
  Client->>SuperAPI: GET /api/devices (Authorization: Bearer <JWT>)

%% 3) WS chat -> message relay -> Typesense indexing
sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant Gateway as Super API
  participant Agent7 as Messaging WS
  participant Search as Search
  Client->>Gateway: WS /api/msg/ws (JWT)
  Gateway->>Agent7: WS proxy
  Agent7-->>Client: welcome
  Client->>Agent7: send message (ciphertext)
  Agent7-->>Client: message delivered
  Agent7->>Search: POST /messages/index

%% 4) Media presign/upload/thumbnail
sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant SuperAPI as Super API
  participant Media as Media Service
  participant MinIO as MinIO
  Client->>SuperAPI: POST /api/media/uploads/presign
  SuperAPI->>Media: POST /uploads/presign
  Media-->>SuperAPI: presigned PUT URL
  SuperAPI-->>Client: presigned URL
  Client->>MinIO: PUT object
  Client->>SuperAPI: GET /api/media/thumb?id=...

%% 5) Event RSVP + reminders
sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant SuperAPI as Super API
  participant Events as Events (Python)
  Client->>SuperAPI: POST /api/events/{slug}/rsvp
  SuperAPI->>Events: forward RSVP
  Events-->>Client: RSVP + ticket token
  Events->>Events: Reminder scheduler enqueues reminders

%% 6) Wallet flow + ledger CSV
sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant SuperAPI as Super API
  participant Wallet as Wallet Service
  Client->>SuperAPI: POST /api/wallet/transactions
  SuperAPI->>Wallet: forward
  Wallet-->>Client: 201 id
  Client->>SuperAPI: GET /api/wallet/admin/ledger.csv

%% 7) Moderation/report/escalation metrics
sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant SuperAPI as Super API
  participant Mod as Moderation Service
  participant Prom as Prometheus
  Client->>SuperAPI: POST /api/mod/reports
  SuperAPI->>Mod: forward
  Mod-->>Client: 201
  Mod->>Prom: /metrics scraped periodically
